WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.020
Writing mobile UI tests by hand is
slow, and they break with every release.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:12.540
Meet WaveQA. It writes those tests for
you, with AI, right on your desktop.

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:18.770
Connect WaveQA's own Android
emulator or iPhone simulator.

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:21.290
Your app runs live, right here.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:26.820
Capture each screen of
the flow you want to test.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:36.340
Click Generate, and pick what
to cover, like the happy path.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:44.440
AI turns your captures into tests and
proposes reusable setup flows like

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:50.280
logging in. Every test is ready
to review and edit step by step.

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:57.730
Save your test data once,
including encrypted credentials.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.920
Then use it in any step.

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:08.290
Run your tests and watch every step pass.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:13.860
No test code to write.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:18.680
Android and iPhone, and export
to WebDriver.io for your CI.

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:23.000
Wave QA, Capture, Generate, Run.
